% holding-blocked: This original is licence-safe and fully notated, but it has not been sung by students. A Grade 5 music teacher must trial the offbeat entries at the proposed tempo, the call-and-response chorus and the lyric stresses; a Jamaican music educator must review the ska history and the offbeat comparison; a second score reader must check the notes and word setting; and someone must replace the discovery search with an authorized link to the Skatalites' "Guns of Navarone" (a label, archive or official artist page).
